  "quality_scope": "On each runtime, two independently confirmed recurring context misses drive bounded training; all variants finish before one winner is frozen. The fixture then authors four held-out groups and two correction/negation regression groups, retaining a nonempty no-evidence control. Fresh paired execution records real fallback work. Six groups show mean retrieval recall gain833333ppm, zero asserted answer failures/regressions/false support, four fewer final-comparison calls and24189 fewer bytes. Native API, native actual qualified Admin UI, native automatic, Docker review and Docker automatic runs pass. Reusing these authored scenarios across runtimes is regression evidence, not a claim of general matching accuracy. Human labels and model decisions remain fallible.",
  "visual_review": {
    "reviewed": true,
    "viewports": [
      "desktop",
      "mobile"
    ],
    "evidence": "Native actual qualified evaluation/promotion and Docker structured settings/selection screens were inspected; content is readable and mobile navigation scrolls horizontally. Browser checks report no overflow or JavaScript errors."
  },
  "development_notes": [
    "Exact retained review, official recipe,18 native vectors and66 independent acceptance cases bind the final accepted artifact. Earlier prototype reports are excluded. CLI owns cache/locks/BOM/receipts.",
    "Per-case recall must not decrease even if mean recall improves and fallback preserves answers; native and independent semantic counterexamples reject this masked regression.",
    "Primitive recipe control is authoritative outside derived rows. Promotion and rollback atomically switch complete caught-up indexes and selection; no human question, label or ownership detail enters global native rows.",
    "Explicit same/deleted operator recipe patches reset the selected override exactly once through the durable hot-configuration journal. Unrelated changes preserve it.",
    "Hot store migration and an actual learned-recipe native-to-Docker runtime upgrade preserve exact selection/revision and prior proof while accurately marking qualification_current false on the new runtime.",
    "Optimizer-owned replay and full-history fallback pause with disabled or nonpending parent policy; independent work and paid in-flight accounting remain intact. Shared direct-analysis starts remain paced while all matching deliveries complete.",
    "Container protocol runner initially failed argument parsing before any protocol assertion. A later cross-runtime comparison found only ordering differences in JSON Schema required-name sets. The final checker normalizes only that schema keyword at schema-bearing locations, preserves source literals and unknown annotations, and rejects changes to membership, constraints or literal/annotation ordering. Complete native/Docker141-fixture HTTP/CLI conformance reruns pass; exact native and Docker schema/OpenAPI snapshots are retained.",
    "The reviewed upstream export fix is separate from this application artifact. ADHD retains its pinned framework and receipt-bound staging; no unreviewed wheel upgrade or upstream release is claimed."
  ],
  "limitations": [
